WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:02.435
Now I just kind of want to talk briefly about

2
00:00:02.435 --> 00:00:05.405
why I picked CMU back
when I was a high schooler.

3
00:00:05.405 --> 00:00:09.109
I really wanted to be surrounded
by people who are deeply invested

4
00:00:09.109 --> 00:00:12.445
in their projects and by a university
who is willing to support that.

5
00:00:12.479 --> 00:00:16.516
And my four years at CMU
have not disappointed me in that respect.

6
00:00:16.549 --> 00:00:21.221
The main reason I chose CMU
is for its entire disciplinary approach.

7
00:00:21.254 --> 00:00:23.690
As we have mentioned
throughout the tour today,

8
00:00:23.690 --> 00:00:26.259
students are not limited
to their own majors.

9
00:00:26.259 --> 00:00:30.463
And in fact, everyone is encouraged
to explore their interests and passion.

10
00:00:30.497 --> 00:00:34.167
I'm really grateful
CMU gives this flexibility to all students

11
00:00:34.167 --> 00:00:36.770
and it's definitely something
to take advantage of.

12
00:00:36.770 --> 00:00:40.106
And with that, thank you so much
for attending our tour today.

13
00:00:40.140 --> 00:00:41.941
If you have any additional questions,

14
00:00:41.941 --> 00:00:43.710
feel free to ask your student ambassadors directly.

15
00:00:43.710 --> 00:00:45.478
Thank you.

